xpansion capabilities.</p><p><br></p><p>The DL380 Gen9 supports Intel Xeon E5-2600 v3 and v4 series processors, allowing businesses to configure the server according to their performance requirements. Its DDR4 SmartMemory support helps provide efficient and scalable memory performance for virtualization, databases, cloud applications, and enterprise workloads.</p><p><br></p><p>With flexible SFF and LFF storage configurations, HPE Smart Array RAID controller options, PCIe expansion, and HP iLO 4 remote management, the DL380 Gen9 can be deployed across a wide range of IT environments.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>HP ProLiant DL380 Gen9 2U Rack Server</li><li>Dual-socket Intel Xeon E5-2600 v3/v4 support</li><li>DDR4 HP SmartMemory support</li><li>Flexible SFF and LFF storage configurations</li><li>SAS and SATA storage support depending on configuration</li><li>HPE Smart Array RAID controller options</li><li>HP iLO 4 remote server management</li><li>PCIe expansion capability</li><li>Multiple Ethernet networking options</li><li>Redundant power supply options</li><li>Scalable enterprise server architecture</li><li>Suitable for virtualization and data center workloads</li><li>Designed for reliable 24/7 business operation</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl380-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL180 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl180-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL380P Gen8 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl380p-gen8-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HPE ProLiant DL360 Gen10 Server","href":"/hpe-proliant-dl360-gen10-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"},{"name":"HP ProLiant DL360 Gen9 Server","href":"/hp-proliant-dl360-gen9-server","now":"","old":"","single":"0৳"}